CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — data files in this directory
===============================================

The two CSV files in this directory are part of the Czehmann et al. (2026)
human-back-translation dataset, distributed by their authors under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):

  * test_subset_backtranslations_sacrebirdphoenix.csv
  * test_full_annotations_sacrebirdphoenix.csv

These files are NOT covered by the repository-wide MIT License (see
/LICENSE at the repository root), which applies only to the software
(source code, scripts, Makefiles, configuration files) authored by the
RCP audit authors.

