    endorses you or your use.
  * NonCommercial — You may not use the material for commercial purposes.
  * ShareAlike — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you
    must distribute your contributions under the same licence as the original.

Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

No changes were made to the data content; the file format (pipe-separated
values) and column schema (name, back translation, translation confidence,
technical quality problems, comment) are preserved verbatim from the original
release.
